ns  The anterior resection margin is inked blue  and the posterior black  The specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm diffusely nodular firm central fibrous area  which abuts the deep margin  Within this fibrous tissue are three fairly well delineated indurated tan pink masses  The first most medial mass in the upper inner quadrant is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm and comes to 0 2cm of the deep margin  Adjacent to this mass along the superomedial aspect is a secondary REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm indurated tan pink nodule which comes to 0 7cm of the deep margin  and is 0 3cm of the mass  The second prominent mass located in the mid upper aspect is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  This second mass comes to 2 1cm of the deep and 0 7cm of the anterior margin  This secondary mass is located 0 8cm superolateral to the first mass  The third mass is located in the upper outer quadrant and measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  This third mass is 1 2cm of the deep margin and 0 3cm of the anterior margin  The 3rd mass is located 1 4cm lateral to the second mass  The surrounding dense fibrous tissue also shows focal areas of induration and blue domed cyst  The remaining cut surface consists predominantly of tan yellow adipose tissue  and sectioning of the lateral breast tissue reveals possible tan pink lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 0 4cm in greatest dimension  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  1 to deep margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Nodule adjacent to mass  1   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue between mass  1 and mass  2   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Radial section of deep margin closest to mass  2   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  2 to anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue between mass  2 and mass  3   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  3 to anterior and posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  3 to anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSI